  "ruleText": "Env-A 102.14 “Air pollutant” means “air contaminant” as defined in RSA 125-C:2, II, reprinted in Appendix C.\n\nSource. #1717, eff 2-19-81; ss by #2332, eff 4-29-83; ss by #2938, eff 12-27-84; rpld by #5033, eff 12-27-90\n\nNew. #5033, eff 12-27-90 (from Env-A 101.06); ss and moved by #6057-A, eff 6-30-95 (from Env-A 101.05); renumbered by #8256 (from Env-A 101.18), (see Revision Note #1 at chapter heading); renumbered by #8304 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading); ss by #13105, eff 9-25-20 (formerly Env-A 101.15) (see Revision Note #4 at chapter heading for Env-A 100)",
